  "description": "<div class=\"product-details-module__title ec-header-h6\" xss=removed>Productgegevens</div>\r\n<div class=\"product-details-module__content\" xss=removed>\r\n<div class=\"product-details__product-attributes\" xss=removed>\r\n<div class=\"details-product-attribute\" xss=removed><span class=\"details-product-attribute__title\" xss=removed>Merk: </span><span class=\"details-product-attribute__value\" xss=removed>AGP</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"productDescription\" class=\"product-details__product-description\" xss=removed>\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"75\" data-end=\"464\">De <span xss=removed data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"100\">AGP SCS7 Waterzaag</span> is een krachtige en precieze <span xss=removed data-start=\"130\" data-end=\"160\">zaagmachine voor nat zagen</span>, ideaal voor tegelwerk, natuursteen en andere bouwmaterialen. Dankzij de waterkoeling wordt oververhitting voorkomen en ontstaat er minder stof, wat zorgt voor een schonere en veiligere werkomgeving. Dit exemplaar verkeert in <span xss=removed data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"422\">zo goed als nieuwe staat (ZGAN)</span> en wordt geleverd <span xss=removed data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"461\">inclusief koffer</span>.</p>\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"485\"><span xss=removed data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"483\">Specificaties</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"486\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"499\">Merk: AGP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"515\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"515\">Model: SCS7</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"545\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"518\" data-end=\"545\">Type: Waterzaag / Natzaag</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"688\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"639\" data-end=\"688\">Toepassing: Tegels, natuursteen, bouwmaterialen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"730\" data-end=\"768\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"768\">Toestand: Zo goed als nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"787\"><span xss=removed data-start=\"770\" data-end=\"785\">Meegeleverd</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"810\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"790\" data-end=\"810\">AGP SCS7 waterzaag</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"811\" data-end=\"827\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"813\" data-end=\"827\">Opbergkoffer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"828\" data-end=\"853\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"830\" data-end=\"853\">Machine in ZGAN staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"870\"><span xss=removed data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"868\">Voordelen</span></p>\r\n<ul xss=removed data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"871\" data-end=\"906\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"906\">Krachtig en nauwkeurig zaagwerk</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"907\" data-end=\"947\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"909\" data-end=\"947\">Waterkoeling voorkomt oververhitting</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"948\" data-end=\"999\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"950\" data-end=\"999\">Compact en ergonomisch voor comfortabel gebruik</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"1000\" data-end=\"1043\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1043\">Volledig getest en direct gebruiksklaar</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li xss=removed data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1086\">\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1086\">Inclusief koffer voor veilig transport</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p xss=removed data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1109\"><span xss=removed data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1097\">Prijs</span><br xss=removed data-start=\"1097\" data-end=\"1100\">€299,99</p>\r\n</div>